                  "name": "<color=#FFFFFFFF>{SPRITE_PRESET#3008}Technique</color>",
                  "desc": "When the active character is equipped with a {SPRITE_PRESET#3008}Technique card, they can use the corresponding {SPRITE_PRESET#3008}Technique.\\nUsing a {SPRITE_PRESET#3008} Technique counts as a Combat Action. If the character is unable to use Skills due to conditions like Frozen, Petrification, or Stun, they are also unable to use the {SPRITE_PRESET#3008}Technique.\\nUsing a {SPRITE_PRESET#3008}Technique is not considered as using a Skill. Therefore, it cannot trigger effects such as \"After using a skill\" or \"After the character triggers an Elemental Reaction.\" Damage dealt by using a {SPRITE_PRESET#3008}Technique is not considered Damage dealt by the character."
